# Mind Whiteboard — Supabase connection (optional)
#
# When BOTH of these are set, the app talks to your Supabase project and shows
# the login screen. When either is missing, the app runs in LOCAL mode using
# localStorage (no login, data stays in the browser) so it works immediately.
#
# The anon key is safe to expose in a client app — it is protected by Row
# Level Security (RLS). See README.md → "Connect Supabase" for setup steps.
#
# Copy this file to ".env" (or ".env.local") and fill in your values.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
